tion@penserra.com<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Championing Education as a Pathway to Equity and Opportunity In January 2021, Penserra CEO Jorge (George) Madrigal and the firm\u2019s partnership launched the Penserra Foundation, a nonprofit organization dedicated to advancing educational opportunities for underserved communities. The Foundation is committed [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"_gspb_post_css":"","_kad_blocks_custom_css":"","_kad_blocks_head_custom_js":"","_kad_blocks_body_custom_js":"","_kad_blocks_footer_custom_js":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4961","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.0 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>The Penserra Foundation<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"The Penserra Foundation\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/penserra-foundation\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Penserra Foundation\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The Penserra Foundation\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/penserra-foundation\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Penserra\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-07-10T21:55:17+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/02\/iStock-648817898.jpg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"801\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:i